<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 644)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>The repeat-scope menu looks like itself.</b> The control beside the loop buttons that chooses what repeats, this clip, all clips, or a range, now shows a &#8220;1&#8221; square, a stack, or a dashed square, so it is no longer mistaken for the in/out range menu next to it.</li>
</ul>
